# Read `.claude/CLAUDE.md` first

This repository keeps one instruction file for every coding agent:
`.claude/CLAUDE.md`. It has the gates, the git rules, the ledger
(`docs/LEDGER.md`, read it first on any resume), Edge Function deploys,
the crypto agents' rules and what a fresh container needs. Read it in
full before changing anything. `working-with-davies.mdc` beside this file
is how the owner works.
